    "title": "Justin Bieber Brings Wizkid and Tems to Coachella Comeback - Coachella Today",
    "text": "Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›Bieber's Coachella comeback set was a night of high-wattage star power and global musical collaboration.Coachella TodayAfter a four-year break from major live performances, Justin Bieber headlined Coachella 2026 on April 12, delivering a deeply personal 34-song set that marked his most significant live performance in years. The show drew an enormous crowd and featured surprise appearances from Wizkid, Tems, and The Kid Laroi, elevating the night beyond simple nostalgia. Why it matters Bieber's Coachella return was a highly anticipated cultural moment, confirming his continued commercial standing and relevance even after years away from touring. The appearance also highlighted Coachella's broader commitment to platforming diverse global music voices. The details Dressed simply in a red hoodie and sunglasses, Bieber opened with \"All I Can Take\" before inviting the audience to request songs through a live YouTube chat, blurring the line between arena spectacle and personal connection. Midway through, he performed a throwback sequence of his own old music videos, creating an unexpectedly moving moment. The Kid Laroi, Wizkid, and Tems joined Bieber as surprise guests, elevating the set beyond nostalgia and positioning him as an artist still actively engaged with the broader musical landscape. Justin Bieber headlined Coachella 2026 on April 12.The second Coachella weekend falls on April 18. The players Justin BieberA Canadian singer-songwriter who headlined Coachella 2026 with a 34-song comeback set.WizkidA Nigerian singer-songwriter who joined Bieber to perform the \"Essence\" remix, a 2021 global hit.TemsA Nigerian singer-songwriter who joined Bieber for a soulful vocal performance on \"I Think You're Special\".The Kid LaroiAn Australian singer-songwriter who joined Bieber to perform their collaborative hit \"Stay\".Hailey BieberJustin Bieber's wife, who was in attendance throughout the evening, dancing in the crowd alongside Kendall Jenner. Got photos? Submit your photos here. › What’s next The second Coachella weekend falls on April 18, leaving open questions about whether the guest lineup will shift, expand or surprise in new directions. The takeaway Bieber's Coachella return marked a highly anticipated cultural moment, confirming his continued commercial standing and relevance even after years away from touring. The appearance also highlighted Coachella's broader commitment to platforming diverse global music voices.",
